-- Housing and Development Act 1959: INDEPENDENT TESTS.
-- Each expected value comes from independent-expectations.md, which was
-- written from ../source/HDA1959.txt before the encoding was read.
-- Tags E01... refer to that file. Expected values are not adjusted to the code.

§ `Independent tests`

§§ `Helpers`

GIVEN owns IS A BOOLEAN, disposed IS A MAYBE DATE, applied IS A DATE, completed IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `Purchase facts`
`buyer` owns disposed applied completed MEANS `Purchase facts` OF owns, `as a list` disposed, applied, completed, FALSE, FALSE
    WHERE
        `as a list` m MEANS
            CONSIDER m
            WHEN JUST x  THEN LIST x
            WHEN NOTHING THEN EMPTY

GIVEN d IS A Dealing, consent IS A BOOLEAN, after1998 IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Dealing facts`
`deal` d consent after1998 MEANS `Dealing facts` OF d, consent, after1998

GIVEN months IS A NUMBER, demand IS A BOOLEAN, irremediable IS A BOOLEAN, days IS A NUMBER, false IS A BOOLEAN, rules IS A BOOLEAN, use IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Re-entry facts`
`reentry` months demand irremediable days false rules use MEANS `Re-entry facts` OF months, demand, irremediable, days, false, rules, use

GIVEN favour IS A NUMBER, total IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Poll result`
`votes` favour total MEANS `Poll result` OF favour, total

GIVEN bankrupt IS A BOOLEAN, months IS A NUMBER, missed IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Member facts`
`member` bankrupt months missed MEANS `Member facts` OF bankrupt, months, FALSE, missed, FALSE

§§ `Buying a flat: s 50(1), (10), s 57, s 92(1)`

-- E01
#ASSERT `entitled to purchase a flat from the Board` (`buyer` FALSE NOTHING (YMD 2026 1 1) NOTHING)
-- E02, E03, E04 (owner, spouse or occupier: one input)
#ASSERT NOT `entitled to purchase a flat from the Board` (`buyer` TRUE NOTHING (YMD 2026 1 1) NOTHING)
